/ One block (|invariants, |discussion, …) inside a term or a group. Its treatment
/ comes from config.yml's `blocks`; whole-line ; comments become notes above the body.
- kind = block_kind(b.name)
- if collapsed?(b.name)
  details.block class=[kind, b.name, scope]
    summary.label = label(b.name)
    == partial("block_body", b: b, group: group)
- else
  .block class=[kind, b.name, scope]
    .label = label(b.name)
    == partial("block_body", b: b, group: group)
